{"version":"1.2.0","category":"25_data_api_integration","entries":[{"expression":"接続口をそろえる","interpretation":"System間のAPI・Protocol・Interface仕様を一致させる","context":["API","System","Interface"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"接続整合","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"データを流す","interpretation":"Dataを後続Systemや処理へ送る","context":["Data","System","処理"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Data送信","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"データを受ける","interpretation":"外部・前段SystemからDataを受信する","context":["Data","System","API"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Data受信","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"データを吐き出す","interpretation":"System内部のDataを外部形式で出力する","context":["Data","出力","System"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Data出力","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"データを詰め替える","interpretation":"Dataを別Schema・形式・Containerへ変換する","context":["Data","Schema","形式"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Data変換","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"橋をかける","interpretation":"互換性のないSystem・形式・責務間を接続する","context":["System","形式","連携"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Integration","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"変換層を挟む","interpretation":"直接互換性がない間に変換処理を追加する","context":["変換","処理","API"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"変換","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"入口を絞る","interpretation":"受け付ける入力・Provider・Requestを限定する","context":["入力","Request","API"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"入口制御","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"出口を分ける","interpretation":"出力先・通知先・処理先を条件に応じて分岐する","context":["出力","通知","処理"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"出口制御","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"配線をつなぐ","interpretation":"Module・API・Event間の接続を実装する","context":["Module","API","Event"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"接続","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"配線をほどく","interpretation":"既存の接続・依存・Event連携を分離する","context":["接続","依存","Event"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"接続解除","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"依存を切る","interpretation":"Component間の直接依存を除去する","context":["依存","Component","Module"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"依存解除","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"依存を閉じ込める","interpretation":"外部依存を限定されたLayer内に隔離する","context":["依存","Layer","外部"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"依存隔離","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"境界をまたぐ","interpretation":"異なる責務・Network・Security境界間でDataを移す","context":["境界","Data","Network"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"境界越境","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"Payloadを丸める","interpretation":"複雑なPayloadを扱いやすい共通形式へ整形する","context":["Payload","形式","API"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Data整形","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"Schemaを寄せる","interpretation":"複数SchemaのField・型・構造を共通形へ近づける","context":["Schema","Field","Data"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Schema整合","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"契約を合わせる","interpretation":"APIやModuleの入出力契約を相互に一致させる","context":["契約","API","Module"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"契約整合","version":"1.2.0"},{"expression":"受け渡しを固める","interpretation":"System間Data Transferの形式・順序・失敗処理を確定する","context":["Data","順序","失敗"],"context_policy":"required_any","domain":"Integration設計","version":"1.2.0"}]}